Package: knowinglivingself
Title: Dashboard for the Knowing and Living the Self Survey
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Reads the KoBoToolbox export in data/ and builds an interactive
    HTML dashboard in public/. Not an installable package; this file lists
    the R packages the build needs.
